the Second Covid Litigation Conference | March 7-8 | Horseshoe Hotel, Las Vegas\nThis Thursday’s VSRF LIVE episode features a conversation led by host Steve Kirsch with attorneys Dale Saran and Brian Festa. Dale Saran is actively representing service members who opted out of COVID-19 vaccination, tackling three significant lawsuits in the U.S. Court of Federal Claims. These cases revolve around denied benefits, pay, and the discharge of a substantial number of service members from various military branches, excluding the Coast Guard. Meanwhile, Brian Festa, co-founder of We the Patriots, focuses on defending constitutional rights through nonpartisan advocacy and litigation. A passionate civil rights attorney, Brian’s involvement in health freedom activism was sparked by his son’s serious reaction to a flu shot. Together, this holiday episode of VSRF LIVE promises a satisfying end-of-year deep dive into the most pressing Covid legal developments. Show less", "thumbnail": "https://1a-1791.com/video/s8/1/p/2/x/Q/p2xQo.qR4e-small-VSRF-Live-107-Covid-Litigat.jpg", "display_id": "v3zv0zm", "fulltitle": "VSRF Live #107: Covid Litigation Updates", "duration_string": "1:59:25", "upload_date": "20231221", "release_date": "20231222", "release_year": 2023, "is_live": false, "was_live": true, "epoch": 1777699025, "url": "https://1a-1791.com/video/vo/af0d/SFDLxgZVpR8/0AIlg_LuzRs.mp4", "format_id": "mp4-1080p-1", "fps": 30, "tbr": 5773, "filesize": 5171533251, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "protocol": "https", "ext": "mp4", "video_ext": "mp4", "audio_ext": "none", "resolution": "1920x1080", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "aspect_ratio": 1.78, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/140.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate"}, "format": "mp4-1080p-1 - 1920x1080", "_type": "video", "_ve